e\">Good!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 z 5 gwiazdek\" data-title-template=\"%s z 5 gwiazdek\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Przez <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/snowamarkazi/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/001a8ee527106665c71b54513a85a748ceb3828578c67523c6f8c959e891a3f5?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/001a8ee527106665c71b54513a85a748ceb3828578c67523c6f8c959e891a3f5?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/snowamarkazi/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">snowamarkazi</a> dnia <span class=\"review-date\">14 października, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Good!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Geweldig</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 z 5 gwiazdek\" data-title-template=\"%s z 5 gwiazdek\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Przez <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/marcelkraan/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bc2e445dfa622562e5bfa79c6d1386d2eea3fd9c75aa5b612aa96d0e15bff5b3?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bc2e445dfa622562e5bfa79c6d1386d2eea3fd9c75aa5b612aa96d0e15bff5b3?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/marcelkraan/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">marcelkraan</a> dnia <span class=\"review-date\">26 września, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ik vind Woocommerce echt geweldig. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">I have almost everything I need.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 z 5 gwiazdek\" data-title-template=\"%s z 5 gwiazdek\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Przez <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/forumsever/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b0e33c1f0f50a5ac656acedb763d4367bcf9514e898c729e21348ebac5261786?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b0e33c1f0f50a5ac656acedb763d4367bcf9514e898c729e21348ebac5261786?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/forumsever/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">forumsever</a> dnia <span class=\"review-date\">24 września, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I really enjoy using it; it makes my job much easier in every way. However, I would like more features for promotions—such as \"Buy X, Pay for Y\" or an \"x% discount on the second item.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Everything is hard</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 z 5 gwiazdek\" data-title-template=\"%s z 5 gwiazdek\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Przez <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/das2019/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45e32a199577635a48a036a6e5f066310f81fdffb46db08a7fda1ee349688238?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45e32a199577635a48a036a6e5f066310f81fdffb46db08a7fda1ee349688238?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/das2019/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">das2019</a> dnia <span class=\"review-date\">9 września, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It works... But I dread having to add or change anything. Simple bulk editing like changing tags of more than 5 products leads to gateway timeout, with some being changed and some not. Editing them one-by-one takes about as much time as waiting for the timeout. Setting up shipping categories-zones-costs is a confusing and convoluted nightmare of multiple screens, tabs, and settings. Misleading warning popups like \"all of these items will be deleted\" instead of \"clicking OK will delete this category name\". And too much of what seems like basic functionality requires paid third-party plugins. It\'s always like that, these examples are just from the last two hours of struggle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">It&#039;s good</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 z 5 gwiazdek\" data-title-template=\"%s z 5 gwiazdek\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Przez <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/almahmudbd/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/079a5e72d2d54c7590ddb0047a7ac2b43ae59bc08a6104fcf3fdc697bdec1cc3?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/079a5e72d2d54c7590ddb0047a7ac2b43ae59bc08a6104fcf3fdc697bdec1cc3?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/almahmudbd/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">almahmud <small>(almahmudbd)</small></a> dnia <span class=\"review-date\">9 września, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s good and so much flexible...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>thanks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 z 5 gwiazdek\" data-title-template=\"%s z 5 gwiazdek\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Przez <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/simonelongato/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/11266e931b9a30aaeeae780c7f75caee6982c8044fcffc63cbdaf196a251234a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/11266e931b9a30aaeeae780c7f75caee6982c8044fcffc63cbdaf196a251234a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/simonelongato/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Simone Longato <small>(simonelongato)</small></a> dnia <span class=\"review-date\">26 sierpnia, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I needed support for some errors in the e-commerce site I manage for our clients. They helped us understand the problem so we could fix it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:169:\"Wszystko, czego potrzebujesz, aby uruchomić sklep internetowy w kilka dni i rozwijać go przez lata. 